{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜新皇崗口岸擠塞問題(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-27-12-54-25HLhnfsrx.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：新皇崗口岸擠塞問題</p><p>剛過去的周末大型活動結束後，新皇崗口岸凌晨一度出現交通擠塞，原因是甚麼？未來如何更有效疏導車流？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>立法會議員(新界北)姚銘</p><p>香港汽車會永遠榮譽會長李耀培</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:01.924945+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:20.176822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:23.327017+00:00","content_hash":"6df5bc345252d4d1fe80f1f25e6cf793004d40b1f6ad6a9a2f42d85879ef6a84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:01.924945+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}